WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.209
One day, Sarah wiggled her tooth.

2
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.289
"Mommy, I have a loose tooth!" she said.

3
00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:20.693
"Do you know who comes when your tooth falls out?" Mommy asked.

4
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:23.303
"Who?" Sarah asked.

5
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:25.916
"You'll see," Mommy said.

6
00:00:25.917 --> 00:00:28.726
Sarah wiggled and wiggled her tooth.

7
00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:31.223
But it didn't come out.

8
00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:36.501
"Daddy, who comes when my tooth falls out?" Sarah asked.

9
00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.301
"Oh, I can't tell you.

10
00:00:38.302 --> 00:00:41.485
You'll see," Daddy said.

11
00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:44.482
Sarah stuck her tongue under her tooth.

12
00:00:44.483 --> 00:00:48.561
She pulled it with one, two, three fingers.

13
00:00:48.562 --> 00:00:51.330
But her tooth didn't come out.

14
00:00:51.331 --> 00:00:54.406
"I can get your tooth out," teased her brother.

15
00:00:54.407 --> 00:00:57.259
"I will tie it to a door with string.

16
00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.319
Then, I'll slam the door."

17
00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.960
But Sarah ran away.

18
00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:06.316
She wiggled her tooth at night.

19
00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:09.287
She wiggled it in the morning.

20
00:01:09.288 --> 00:01:12.452
She even wiggled it when she was at school.

21
00:01:12.453 --> 00:01:16.140
But the tooth didn't come out.

22
00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.642
Finally, she forgot all about it.

23
00:01:18.643 --> 00:01:21.852
After school, she bit into an apple.

24
00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:24.202
Oops, there it was.

25
00:01:24.203 --> 00:01:27.196
Her tooth was stuck in the apple!

26
00:01:27.197 --> 00:01:36.636
Mommy said, "Put it under your pillow tonight."

27
00:01:36.637 --> 00:01:40.072
The next morning, Sarah looked under her pillow.

28
00:01:40.073 --> 00:01:44.431
Her tooth was gone, and there was money instead!

29
00:01:44.432 --> 00:01:47.988
Mommy asked, "Did the tooth fairy come?"

30
00:01:47.989 --> 00:01:50.743
Sarah held up her money and smiled.

31
00:01:50.744 --> 00:01:54.852
"I can't wait until the next tooth is loose!"
